/repos/curl/curl/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/deployments","created_at":"2010-03-18T22:32:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T23:57:49Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T23:57:45Z","git_url":"git://github.com/curl/curl.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:curl/curl.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl","homepage":"https://curl.se/","size":124054,"stargazers_count":40144,"watchers_count":40144,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6982,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":25,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","client","curl","ftp","gopher","hacktoberfest","http","https","imaps","ldap","libcurl","library","mqtt","pop3","scp","sftp","transfer-data","transferring-data","user-agent","websocket"],"visibility":"public","forks":6982,"open_issues":25,"watchers":40144,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### I did this\r\n\r\nWe are using libcurl in our in-house software.\r\nThe code uses SFTP with libssh2 via the curl_easy interface.\r\nWe are setting `CURLOPT_DEBUGFUNCTION` to get as much information as possible and record it in our own log files.\r\nWe had an unrelated bug [6990](https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/6990) that should have output an error message using `failf`.\r\nEven after this bug is fixed and that particular call is not executed any more, there are calls to `infof` in the disconnect code that we would like to get.\r\n\r\n### I expected the following\r\n\r\nMy debug function should have been called, but it wasn't.\r\n\r\n### curl/libcurl version\r\n\r\nGit master\r\n\r\n### operating system\r\n\r\nDebian buster, also tested on bullseye/sid.\r\n\r\n### Initial analysis\r\n\r\nIt seems that the CURL handle (`Curl_easy` struct)  that is passed to `libssh2.sftp_disconnect` is not the same as the one used during the SFTP data transfer where we registered the debug function.  This second handle comes from `Curl_conncache_close_all_connections`.  From my debugging the struct member `set.fdebug` is set to NULL in the `Curl_easy` struct in `sftp_disconnect` instead of my configured debug callback.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/6995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/6995/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4681478843,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50NDY4MTQ3ODg0Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/events/4681478843","actor":{"login":"bagder","id":177011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder","html_url":"https://github.com/bagder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user